        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Canon Templates\n\nThe starter graphs that other graphs are made from, and the standard each one follows.\n\n**Rules.** What a canon template is: thirteen rules, each with its reason and how it is checked.\n\n**Templates.** The Page, Task, Collection, Repo and Declaration templates, and the Document Starter.\n\nThis graph is a collection. Each tile is a portal it contains, and what a tile shows is read from the graph behind it."
